{"type": "header", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "load_s": 1.345, "peak_rss_mb": 515.3, "num_sentences": 30, "decode_params": {"model": "k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx tts-models/kokoro-int8-multi-lang-v1_1.tar.bz2", "model_file": "model.int8.onnx", "lexicons": ["lexicon-us-en.txt", "lexicon-zh.txt"], "rule_fsts": ["date-zh.fst", "phone-zh.fst", "number-zh.fst"], "sid": 6, "speaker": "zf_004", "speed": 1.0, "num_threads": 4}}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.203, "n_samples": 100867, "proc_s": 5.3872, "rtf": 1.2818, "samples_sha256": "ebf50fd6ec217e64485b5e8b4dd93a7c39b78c3dee31231a5c16af5494ba4afb"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.882, "n_samples": 117170, "proc_s": 6.5968, "rtf": 1.3512, "samples_sha256": "d95e27ca5aed5a9aa421fcfc8fe5fcd39a62b67eda7ddf7e939d0e49ea2966a2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.796, "n_samples": 91116, "proc_s": 4.6733, "rtf": 1.231, "samples_sha256": "3bb6b27b01a92c66d9493bd76aa2edf6e133b2429290e71511c0238a9fc1dbba"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.01, "n_samples": 96231, "proc_s": 4.7878, "rtf": 1.1941, "samples_sha256": "a60b2cd5939b465ec81078bf4372201584015158098637df78a78c8900668aa8"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.119, "n_samples": 74848, "proc_s": 4.196, "rtf": 1.3454, "samples_sha256": "e37bab0e814b6deb378fbedf57341760ee2b9e767a9f91a2fd60112a626b4042"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.947, "n_samples": 94719, "proc_s": 5.2369, "rtf": 1.3269, "samples_sha256": "624167d054f4f52e08473ba34fcc504a4dcc788e6480764b3826a982a0a185e5"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.126, "n_samples": 123025, "proc_s": 7.1586, "rtf": 1.3965, "samples_sha256": "8170cf11945e02e85a699bb8a2cd677773327b9dedba85fbf11436517bea54d0"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.803, "n_samples": 91261, "proc_s": 4.7198, "rtf": 1.2412, "samples_sha256": "a94619d5ea9118bc20f0cac152a3675aff53afeedebb585a54b1a28ffc94c21b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.028, "n_samples": 96661, "proc_s": 5.4166, "rtf": 1.3449, "samples_sha256": "69c90a507df6989c2841bf6723ea6fe2a847609f6c94fb50f81c53a7617133b4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.139, "n_samples": 99348, "proc_s": 5.8781, "rtf": 1.42, "samples_sha256": "4500e9c286a1c02385188b72bded984bf8a8e3d614a344036ee2cdfa129b5fe4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.939, "n_samples": 70543, "proc_s": 3.5876, "rtf": 1.2206, "samples_sha256": "4875e2db5345a6397295d77fd8bce1073ee2d20746ea41c73f69a61f6444c30d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.11, "n_samples": 98642, "proc_s": 4.8983, "rtf": 1.1918, "samples_sha256": "05b0059c8910587693c2cc1da460c58036e766893b3ca86c69ac88cb23dbdb0b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.39, "n_samples": 105359, "proc_s": 5.5636, "rtf": 1.2673, "samples_sha256": "0ab42c28f46460efa28379502ae459fa330f8bccc7bfabb5c8ab799c6e13db40"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.415, "n_samples": 129965, "proc_s": 6.9727, "rtf": 1.2876, "samples_sha256": "7779b74b09e0ce4f27da048a3641de470001a9369242b3f362a39c9fc08d51af"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.493, "n_samples": 83837, "proc_s": 4.0781, "rtf": 1.1674, "samples_sha256": "5f6d7732ed7ac1365e085604185c2c79ab296dcbd52ad366e4543787e8828bd3"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.517, "n_samples": 84405, "proc_s": 4.2375, "rtf": 1.2049, "samples_sha256": "6f7401016a873aa1a29bce367fcc720ae7e31c22d0a7fdbb13e659ffdd3f1d89"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.067, "n_samples": 97612, "proc_s": 5.2682, "rtf": 1.2953, "samples_sha256": "33d09dee1ba7c23d975ba68f9ba5892333b4b436c0a787969cb96ec278d61a01"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.854, "n_samples": 92500, "proc_s": 4.4894, "rtf": 1.1648, "samples_sha256": "f79108307faa7a7e4016a0051e0badb170166189c74281136242c1bac98fc0fb"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.328, "n_samples": 55869, "proc_s": 2.8614, "rtf": 1.2292, "samples_sha256": "d73f2c8067ba889794887077c39d0c7389c4c816b4cfa829244b2bfb138d328e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.032, "n_samples": 96776, "proc_s": 5.2984, "rtf": 1.314, "samples_sha256": "97135c76ef83ac1dac3deba51414fd7228c45698a3780bfa24dedad6d0e4a4af"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.12, "n_samples": 98882, "proc_s": 5.2775, "rtf": 1.2809, "samples_sha256": "fa77a77b86ea3267f1edcf665c4f303490ead6c7193b221008dcc3c64c768cdf"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.012, "n_samples": 120277, "proc_s": 6.1644, "rtf": 1.23, "samples_sha256": "526539b20a4f824284d00a345b1708f3961f5e4567c353c9da8b97f6bec7f799"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.051, "n_samples": 97222, "proc_s": 4.7617, "rtf": 1.1755, "samples_sha256": "9455fb40dad96b29255fd95e2f1972dc5b3a827f6cbd67e68cbc1fb5d8bfd483"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.221, "n_samples": 101300, "proc_s": 5.7832, "rtf": 1.3702, "samples_sha256": "001b0037785aabcc63420d09a1498a9518157e5fd168c577760c42cc09e84638"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.3, "n_samples": 103211, "proc_s": 5.3436, "rtf": 1.2426, "samples_sha256": "3870bffae5c69848c833a1698a8aa444fb4825aa1f944888b6e26db70f7ebc06"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.42, "n_samples": 82077, "proc_s": 4.1326, "rtf": 1.2084, "samples_sha256": "4ddf692d954d430c6c80b5514bb155657d842acd1d053dd5d571cb893be82ebc"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.751, "n_samples": 114031, "proc_s": 5.8091, "rtf": 1.2226, "samples_sha256": "b62d9f29a4edd9b8c615bf80c4d21d2b6af237cb1c506e63806962ebd47d2f03"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s028", "text": "医生建议我每天喝8杯水。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.92, "n_samples": 70068, "proc_s": 3.5328, "rtf": 1.2101, "samples_sha256": "6bb00a0409d4ef883a7e52cb76cb7868b3599157a08c17df78ef1f2b3a90b6c7"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s029", "text": "我们团队一共有12个人，分成3个小组。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.478, "n_samples": 107483, "proc_s": 5.3967, "rtf": 1.205, "samples_sha256": "1c64f5f7b3c5e17725f6d857f9383550eeb8193f8e7a286ff2bb43f748fdcc68"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid6", "sentence_id": "s030", "text": "谢谢你的帮忙，下次我请你喝咖啡。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.972, "n_samples": 95326, "proc_s": 4.8034, "rtf": 1.2093, "samples_sha256": "8c4321b7ff75fca5518d12275c2807c3390e362f6b57f5c37f30ab335a4556ce"}
